{"v":4,"catch":"一款關於身為怪獸結交好友的可愛解謎遊戲。","desc":"就算是怪獸也需要朋友！繼續探索《怪獸遠征》的世界，在一系列輕鬆好理解的謎題中結交新朋友。在這座冬季花園裡，雪和空間都是有限的，必須有清明的頭腦、遠大的胸襟才能擁抱它們。\n\n• 《Sokobond》風格的推方塊謎題，加上一點冷颼颼的變化。\n• 圖形可愛、謎題有趣，來自《怪獸遠征》和《Cosmic Express》團隊的傑作\n• Priscilla Snow（《Voyageur》、《JETT: The Far Shore》、《Patrick's Parabox》）的迷人原聲帶","publisher":"Draknek","release":"2021-09-02","genres":["益智","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","葡萄牙文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9c9e917609536afa2c4ef9723d57ea99455bc0fd6f3cfc2effde7fc7cb127e02.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a60512a1140ea20669637d761a2de9f6fcace763e34e74ed2efc3093efb0bfa2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ed32a5492df76d89b1a0a95c4117db436a47c201a516aac423f0ff128f4b0353.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fdc58a58d9a016932049cae5725560b715f809b8d5d2a542e5c2d46a77326849.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/19e757fb762cee937054845d8c3eccc336db28035d955309b1ddde61862a5ae1.jpg"],"titleId":"0100423013306000","dlc":[]}